# [SteeringAngleControl] 全向舵轮驻车：四轮可独立设置目标舵角，轮速保持为 0。
# Server: mobile_cmd_omni (/steering_angle_control)
# Client: BT 节点 ParkWheels（nav2_behavior_tree）

#goal definition
# 四轮目标舵角（rad），顺序：FL、FR、RL、RR。
#ros2 action send_goal /steering_angle_control
#    nav_interfaces/action/SteeringAngleControl
#    "{target_steer_angles_rad: [0.2, -0.4, 1.0, -1.2],
#      timeout_sec: 3.0,
#      settle_tolerance_rad: 0.08}"
#    --feedback
float32[4] target_steer_angles_rad
float32 timeout_sec
float32 settle_tolerance_rad
---
#result definition
builtin_interfaces/Duration total_elapsed_time
bool success
string message
---
#feedback definition
float32 max_steer_error
builtin_interfaces/Duration time_left